# ---------- Assets ----------
# Portfolio media (About visual, Shoonya photographs, resume PDF) now lives in
# frontend/public/ and is published. .gitignore must NOT exclude it, or a fresh
# clone would serve 404s for every image and the resume download. Keep this
# section free of **/public/media patterns unless you intentionally want to
# withhold a specific file again.

